id: pm-gh1535
title: "GH-1535: report context test health over the matching population"
description: "Reproduce GH-1535: tests counters use the focus page while summary uses matching_items. Compute test health over the same filtered active population independently of focus limits. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1535"
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-21T16:30:10.816Z"
