completed_at: "2026-10-21T17:34:14.519Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: Test counters are invariant under focus limits; Filters and active statuses constrain the denominator; Public SDK and human output declare test scope and denominator
parent: pm-gh1361
risk: medium
confidence: 90
resolution: "Aggregate test health across all matching active items and expose matching_active_items scope and total_items in SDK types and Markdown, with migration guidance and recurrence coverage."
expected_result: Focus limits do not change test-health counts; filters and schema active-status semantics determine an explicit denominator.
actual_result: "SDK CLI and MCP at limits1/10 report3 test-bearing items among4 matching active items and the same failing run, excluding draft and other-tag items. Plain-directory acceptance reports3/3 at both limits. All46 linked cases, typecheck, lint and source/static contracts pass. Local startup-floor admission remains failed and final hosted static and coverage are required before merge."
